      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t see any mention of the intentional no-rounding in the original code, nor the \"tolerance range\". If performance is that sensitive, would you suggest a test case so I can measure the performance impact?\n\nIn addition, such minute rendering differences could enable digital fingerprinting, and make comparison results with other architectures unnecessarily noisy. With this change applied loong64 actually produces mostly identical output as amd64 for the dm test suite.",
