      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T18:15:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I don\u0027t think it\u0027s an acceptable compromise, because doing so makes reasoning about compiled code a lot harder due to all the optimizations. At the very least, we should probably remove the assertion on loong64 and other platforms without the x86-and-arm-like rounding (if there are any); I doubt that would be feasible either.",
